WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.237
In 1884,

2
00:00:01.237 --> 00:00:04.026
European powers met in Berlin

3
00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:06.473
to set rules for claiming

4
00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:09.765
Africa. No Africans were present.

5
00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:13.763
The Berlin Conference opened in

6
00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:15.604
1884. By 1914,

7
00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:17.799
nearly all of Africa was

8
00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:20.080
under European rule.

9
00:00:20.415 --> 00:00:22.568
Raw materials and markets.

10
00:00:22.568 --> 00:00:24.934
And prestige and strategy.

11
00:00:25.284 --> 00:00:28.024
The syllabus also covers colonialism

12
00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:31.041
in Asia and Latin America.

13
00:00:31.393 --> 00:00:32.570
Your turn.

14
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.516
What was it about?
